  <Docs>
    <summary>Defines UI customization options specific to the embedded Photo Picker interface.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Defines UI customization options specific to the embedded Photo Picker interface.</para>
      <para>This immutable class allows an application to specify visual preferences to optimize the user experience within the picker.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/widget/photopicker/EmbeddedPhotoPickerUiCustomizationParams" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.widget.photopicker.EmbeddedPhotoPickerUiCustomizationParams</code>.</a></format></para>
